{"4584160": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Deck of Potential", "steam_appid": 4584160, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4584160/extras/bc903e1420043d37841b111350449f22.poster.avif?t=1784151491\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4584160/extras/bc903e1420043d37841b111350449f22.webm?t=1784151491\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4584160/extras/bc903e1420043d37841b111350449f22.mp4?t=1784151491\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Roguelike deckbuilder combined with bullet heaven</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat swarming enemies, collect coins to open card packs, and survive by constantly strengthening your deck.<br>Take down dungeon bosses, unlock new cards, characters, and discover fusion recipes to build the ultimate auto-firing deck.<br>There are no card limits. Build a massive deck of hundreds of cards.<br>Cards are automatically played toward enemies at set intervals. Focus on avoiding the horde to survive, and building an efficient deck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4584160/extras/3639c5bae82d091ea1f59602c714d7ed.poster.avif?t=1784151491\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4584160/extras/3639c5bae82d091ea1f59602c714d7ed.webm?t=1784151491\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4584160/extras/3639c5bae82d091ea1f59602c714d7ed.mp4?t=1784151491\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your character. Each possesses unique effects that offer distinct ways to handle your cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4584160/extras/4b03c3b1d6f8aa559204547aa07a1b4f.poster.avif?t=1784151491\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4584160/extras/4b03c3b1d6f8aa559204547aa07a1b4f.webm?t=1784151491\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4584160/extras/4b03c3b1d6f8aa559204547aa07a1b4f.mp4?t=1784151491\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Power Up Your Deck</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you’ve saved up enough coins, open card packs at any time to add new cards and upgrade your deck.<br>If you hold two combinable cards, you may discover a fused, superior card when opening a pack.   <br>Discover fusion recipes as you play and optimize your deck strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4584160/extras/b2da0b46c26362d45ed59194d55975f5.avif?t=1784151491\" width=1516 height=678 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cards with Stickers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stickers can be attached to cards to boost their power or grant unique effects. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even identical cards can function differently depending on the stickers they carry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4584160/extras/ba0b9cbc0051d97f97a5c30db392fbb6.poster.avif?t=1784151491\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4584160/extras/ba0b9cbc0051d97f97a5c30db392fbb6.webm?t=1784151491\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4584160/extras/ba0b9cbc0051d97f97a5c30db392fbb6.mp4?t=1784151491\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build the ultimate auto-firing deck to survive relentless hordes of monsters. Defeat the boss and emerge victorious!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4584160/extras/bc903e1420043d37841b111350449f22.poster.avif?t=1784151491\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4584160/extras/bc903e1420043d37841b111350449f22.webm?t=1784151491\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4584160/extras/bc903e1420043d37841b111350449f22.mp4?t=1784151491\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Roguelike deckbuilder combined with bullet heaven</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat swarming enemies, collect coins to open card packs, and survive by constantly strengthening your deck.<br>Take down dungeon bosses, unlock new cards, characters, and discover fusion recipes to build the ultimate auto-firing deck.<br>There are no card limits. Build a massive deck of hundreds of cards.<br>Cards are automatically played toward enemies at set intervals. Focus on avoiding the horde to survive, and building an efficient deck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span clas