84151491\" width=1516 height=678 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cards with Stickers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stickers can be attached to cards to boost their power or grant unique effects. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even identical cards can function differently depending on the stickers they carry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4584160/extras/ba0b9cbc0051d97f97a5c30db392fbb6.poster.avif?t=1784151491\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4584160/extras/ba0b9cbc0051d97f97a5c30db392fbb6.webm?t=1784151491\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4584160/extras/ba0b9cbc0051d97f97a5c30db392fbb6.mp4?t=1784151491\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build the ultimate auto-firing deck to survive relentless hordes of monsters. Defeat the boss and emerge victorious!</p>", "short_description": "Deck of Potential combines roguelike deckbuilder with bullet heaven. Collect cards, fuse them, and slap on sticker upgrades to beat thousands of monsters. Take down dungeon bosses, unlock new cards, characters, and discover fusion recipes to build the ultimate auto-firing deck.", "supported_languages": "English, Korean, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, Portuguese - Brazil, Traditional Chinese", "reviews": "“I love it. It's literally 'Upgrade P***'.”<br>Zueljin Gaming<br><br>“It's a game of pure dopamine, where by the end you're casting abilities and destroying thousands of enemies in under two seconds.”<br>Kurindie<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4584160/c42bd7e66b12547fab77db601b07071347c1b49c/header.jpg?t=178415149